msgid ""
"Create VERSION with the latest debian/changelog version (one line). "
"Enable .githooks/pre-commit: git config core.hooksPath .githooks"
msgstr ""
"Hozza létre a VERSION fájlt a legújabb debian/changelog verzióval (egy sor). "
